🚀 feature request

 Relevant Package

This feature request is for @angular/core

 Description
 Angular should provide a way to get error details like source, lineno, colno etc that we get using window onerror event handler -



window.onerror = function(message, source, lineno, colno, error) { ... };

The current error handling mechanism does not provide complete error details. Also, this document mentions the error type as any, it should instead be a proper interface explaining what properties are available in error object -

class ErrorHandler {
 handleError(error: any): void
}

